<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Micron reiterated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Micron reiterated.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it reiterated Micron Technoogy Inc as an intermediate-term accumulate and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Micron was up 1-11/16 to 42-9/16.</p>
</text>
